rule DefaultToFrontierRelease
	statement: Unless a persona is named otherwise, answer from ReleaseId retail-frontier-v1 (the Rhea Bansal household). Customer rhea~legacy is an older, non-reconciled copy of the same person from retail4-v1: it is superseded and must never be merged with rhea or added to rhea's totals.
	lineageTag: 29ed1be2-c211-59bf-a787-e3912fccb346

	ruleReferencedEntity Customer
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty ReleaseId

		ruleReferencedProperty SupersededByCustomerId

		ruleReferencedProperty CustomerId
